Engineering-use disclaimer

This software is a structural-engineering calculator. Outputs are intended
for preliminary design and educational use only. The authors and contributors
are not responsible for any engineering decisions made on the basis of this
software's output. All designs must be independently verified by a qualified
licensed engineer against the relevant design codes before being used in
construction.
